(Refundly Refund Policy & Service Requirements v2.0) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(The November 2026 policy update clarifies refund controls following an internal payment) Tj T*
(review. Amounts are denominated in the order currency. A refund is issued only when the) Tj T*
(gateway accepts it.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Requirement R-A) Tj T*
(A refund may never exceed the captured amount minus refunds already issued.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Requirement R-B) Tj T*
(Refunds requested more than 90 days after the order date require manager approval.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Requirement R-C) Tj T*
(Every issued refund must create an audit record containing actor, amount, reason and) Tj T*
(order id.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Requirement R-D) Tj T*
(A refund must be returned to the original payment method; requests to a different method) Tj T*
(are rejected, except for the gift card policy below.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Requirement R-E) Tj T*
(Orders paid by gift card are refunded only as store credit.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Requirement R-F) Tj T*
(Refund requests are idempotent: the same request_id processed twice results in exactly) Tj T*
(one refund.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Requirement R-G) Tj T*
(Gateway refund calls are retried at most 3 times; after the third failure the refund is) Tj T*
(marked FAILED and no money moves.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Requirement R-H) Tj T*
(Partial refund amounts are rounded down to the cent.) Tj T*
